19s, Inc. leverages its multi-brand, multi-category and multi-channel model to provide a high level of flexibility to read and react to shifting consumer demand and caters to an annual customer base of nearly 40 million active consumers.","filed":"2026-03-27","text_path":"text/M/0001628280-26-021721-business.txt","text_chars":20956}}